<http://data.silknow.org/object/8b4dc37d-9ccc-3a51-971f-700eed3661e3>
        a                       ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment            "Dress fabric of plain weave silk brocaded with silk and metal thread. Two pieces joined down the centre. Blue ground with offset bands of a large flower with two leaves facing in the opposite direction in alternate rows. Between each flower is a small flower leaning in the same direction. The colour of the flowers also alternates and it is either outlined in pink or in brown. The centre of the leaves and the petals is worked with metal thread which is silver strip open S-wound on a yellow silk core."@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk with silk and metal threads, Iran, 1800-1880"@en ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note        "Dress fabric of plain weave silk brocaded with silk and metal thread. Two pieces joined down the centre. Blue ground with offset bands of a large flower with two leaves facing in the opposite direction in alternate rows. Between each flower is a small flower leaning in the same direction. The colour of the flowers also alternates and it is either outlined in pink or in brown. The centre of the leaves and the petals is worked with metal thread which is silver strip open S-wound on a yellow silk core."@en , "Dress fabric of brocaded silk with silk and metal threads, Iran, 1800-1880"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8b4dc37d-9ccc-3a51-971f-700eed3661e3/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8b4dc37d-9ccc-3a51-971f-700eed3661e3/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8b4dc37d-9ccc-3a51-971f-700eed3661e3/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8b4dc37d-9ccc-3a51-971f-700eed3661e3/dimension/2> ;
